# What must not be uploaded to a deployment.
#
# The Vercel CLI honours .gitignore, so most of this is already covered. It is
# written out anyway because the consequence of one of these slipping through
# is not a broken build — it is a private key on a public host, and a rule
# that only exists by inheritance is a rule nobody can check.

# Secrets. The deployment runs with no key on purpose: without one the
# summary-grading route reports itself unconfigured and the "Check my recall"
# button never renders. See SECURITY.md.
.env
.env.*

# Build output and dependencies — the platform produces its own.
.next
node_modules
*.tsbuildinfo

# Scratch beside the scanners: probe screenshots, recordings, throwaway
# scripts. Same rule as .gitignore, for the same reason.
scripts/.*

# Nothing here is served by the app.
docs
demo
.github
.claude
